WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.480
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.740
Huh? A solo live?

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:16.870
Yes, that's right. A close friend of mine just opened a new concert hall.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:20.290
He's holding a concert to commemorate its opening.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:27.130
He wished for an idol of Four Star Academy to perform the honors,

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.670
and so he came to me.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.630
<i>Should I do it?</i>

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.880
<i>I'm still scared of going on stage alone.{or afraid to go}</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.140
I...

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.260
As I recall,

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.520
you resolved yourself to become a top idol.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:48.480
Is this not the perfect opportunity for you to face your present difficulties head-on?

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.150
Consider it a trial conferred upon you by the Goddess of the Stage.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:56.360
I will also give you a test.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:57.410
A test?

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:03.370
If you cannot raise the audience's 
satisfaction meter above ninety percent,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.830
I will have you expelled from this school.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:13.460
So long as your heart is strong, you'll be able to surmount any difficulties you may face.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.300
I understand.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.610
Did I hear correctly?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.240
Will Yume-chan really be holding a solo live?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.360
Yes.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.530
I expect you have a plan.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:04.450
You should understand better than anyone.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.960
If she can overcome the strange power during her concert,

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:15.750
then Nijino Yume will no longer have to fear losing her ability to sing.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.670
Do you mean to say that you've deliberately subjected Yume-chan to this trial?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.880
Very well.

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.260
Watch over her.

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.300
And Shiratori...

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.140
Take this.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:30.640
This is...

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.110
Hopefully she will be able to help.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.650
Expelled?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.480
Yeah.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.780
What is the meaning of that absurd requirement?!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:46.160
Getting the satisfaction meter over ninety percent... That's a high hurdle to clear.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.370
Yume, are you taking this okay?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.660
Yeah, I know that I've just gotta do it.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.420
That's what I like to hear!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.420
Great, you're back to normal.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.800
Yeah! I'll do my best!

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:04.590
See you.

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:11.430
Why would the headmaster subject Yume to such an ordeal?

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.810
I'm not sure, but at the very least,

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:18.190
those two have become true rivals at last.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.110
That's for certain.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.610
Hey, Yume, just let me know.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.570
Know what?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.700
If there's anything I can do for you.

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:32.210
Aren't we true rivals now?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:33.830
Rola.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.630
Though knowing you, I'm sure you'll never give up.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.460
Yeah!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.710
Bye.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.670
Rola!

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:44.220
Yeah?

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.090
Thanks for everything!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.730
<i>Yume, I'll be waiting for you.</i>

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.610
Koharu-chan...

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.990
My back's against the wall here.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:09.240
But I knew it myself, too.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:13.620
I'd started relying on that strange power.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.830
How can I stop it from happening?

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:25.880
What should I do, Koharu-chan?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.510
I'm at a complete loss.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.700
<i>My voice... isn't working!</i>

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.040
No, stop!

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.580
Okay, no more negativity!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:02.130
Here.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.420
Hime-senpai.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:11.350
It's a Hime special, a honey ginger drink.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.270
Thank you.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.480
What's the matter?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.770
I can't do this...

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:25.190
I can't do this at all...

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.030
Yume-chan.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.790
Well? Have you calmed down a bit?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.500
Yes, thank you.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:45.840
But still, I don't have the confidence to go through with my solo live.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.630
You're not acting like yourself!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:52.180
Or so I'd like to say, but it's not so simple.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.220
And I know how hard you're working already.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.600
Those are just the only words I can offer.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:05.610
I was relying on that power.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:09.700
It's okay. Don't cry, Yume-chan.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.780
I'm sorry.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:16.160
The headmaster asked me to pass something on.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:22.000
Your solo live will be that venue's opening concert, right?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.420
Yes, that's what I heard.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:29.340
They want to decorate the entrance with flowers, and he'd like you to pick them out.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.630
He wants me to pick?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.050
Look here.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:36.390
He wanted you to pick from this flower shop.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.680
<i>Yukino Hotaru...</i>

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:45.610
<i>Something might come to you if you go.</i>

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.440
This is it.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.820
Oh, come on in. {IT'S YUKANA}{I am aggressively unenthused}

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.310
Oh, look what you found.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.070
That picture is me-from-the-past.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.570
I thought so.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.830
This is my original blend of rose tea using flowers grown here.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:41.080
It's stunning. Thank you so much.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:46.670
Hot!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.090
I have a sensitive tongue.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.090
Sorry for startling you.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.840
It's fine.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.720
This is delicious.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.850
They're gorgeous.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.730
And you grow so many.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:09.570
Thank you. You can pick whichever ones you'd like for the concert hall later.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.400
Sure.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.950
I see, you want to know about that strange power.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.870
Please.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.870
Hime-senpai told me...

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.200
Do you mean Shiratori Hime-san?

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.040
You know about her?

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:31.460
Yes. I've never met her personally, but I've heard a lot from my younger brother Hikaru.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.760
Hikaru?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.470
He's your headmaster.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:40.510
When I heard that Shiratori-san had that power, I went straight to Hikaru.

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:44.140
He needed to let her know that she must not rely on her power.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:47.560
And it seems that Shiratori-san defeated it splendidly.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.940
I know that I have to do the same too.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.440
If I don't...

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:59.530
You'll lose your ability to sing, much like I did.{can you just get a better idiolect and we can save like 5 minutes of future time}

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:06.410
I became conscious of that strange power a little bit before I joined S4.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:12.550
Back then, S4 had only just been formed, and didn't have much of a reputation.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:19.050
We all worked our hardest to proclaim to the world that the idols of Four Star Academy had arrived.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.050
I became aware of it during that time.

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:27.730
Whenever I took the stage, a strange power would give me a boost.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.810
You must have felt the same thing.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.570
I did.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:37.070
After that, it became so much more fun to sing!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.030
It was the same with me.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:42.240
That eventually led me into S4.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:48.330
It was also right around when Four Star Academy's idols were starting to garner attention.{I know you didn't but this}{considered but then}

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:52.540
I felt pushed to rely more on my power.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:11:00.550
At the time, there was nobody, myself included, who fully understood that mysterious power.

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.720
No one could have known...

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:07.770
Yes?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.270
Nee-san, are you not feeling well again?

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:12.980
I'm fine.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:18.110
Are you sure this isn't because of that weird power?

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.070
You can't keep abusing it.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:23.820
Right now is the time S4 needs to dig in.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.410
We have to work our hardest!

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:27.200
But!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.120
I'm going.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:40.720
And after relying on it one too many times, the power finally took my song away.{they make a point of saying that it's not her/yume's power though}{also I like this}

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.390
Do you regret it?

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.390
I do have regrets.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:50.060
But they're not because I relied too much on the power.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:54.480
I regret my own weakness for thinking I was worthless without it.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:12:01.110
Thinking back, my brother and my friends in S4 had been saying it all along.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.450
They kept telling me I'd be just fine.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:07.450
And yet, I couldn't believe in myself.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:14.250
Don't you have Shiratori-san worrying over you, and friends who reassure you at every step?{nice japanesish wording that isn't a literal translation at all}

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:17.750
Yes! I also have a true rival.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:21.130
Then I guarantee you'll be fine.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:27.050
As long as there are people supporting you, you'll be able to believe in yourself.{this one doesn't even have an "if"!}

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:30.520
And if you believe in yourself, 
I know you can overcome it.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.310
Okay.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.850
I'm starving after all that talking we did.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:39.730
Oh, that's right! I baked a rose chiffon cake today.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:40.900
Would you like a slice?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:41.780
Sure!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.700
Expelled?

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:48.330
Goodness, that Hikaru. He really said that?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:53.330
But if you ask me, he probably only did it because he believes in you.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.330
Right, isn't there that saying?

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.630
The skilled hawk drops its children off the cliff! I think...{skilled hawk hides its talons/the lion cliff thing}{nou aru taka wa sou // mienai toko ni pikku kakusu n desu}

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.840
Or was it different...

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.050
I think you meant to say lion.

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.850
Now then, which roses would you like?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.600
I want to use those!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:16.770
Here.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.480
It matches the color of your hair.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.780
I'm sure they'll love them.{the event organizers, audience, etc.}{I thought she was Mikuruing}

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:24.740
Thank you.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.610
<i>I need to believe in myself!</i>

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:31.910
<i>I won't rely on that mysterious power, and still put on a great show!</i>

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.120
Rola!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:38.170
Yume?

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.170
What's up?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.460
Wanna come with me for a run?

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:46.340
I need to build up stamina for my solo live.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.510
Sure thing!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:53.390
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.230
Subaru-kyun...

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.600
Hey, Ako-chan.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.110
H-How can I help you?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:05.610
I wanted some good lines to use when I MC, and I was hoping you could help me out.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.950
I suppose if you insist.{it's a straight shikata nai desu wa, why are you not it can't be helped}

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:12.790
My MC techniques are a trade secret, I'll have you know.

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:16.960
But Nijino Yume, I will offer you my services on goodwill.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.670
Thanks!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:22.840
However, my lessons are not to be taken lightly.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.800
Drop out and you'll bear my full wrath.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:26.800
I won't!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:32.970
The stage you'll be performing on uses a cute candy motif, so to match your dress to it,

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:36.770
you could try wearing chocolate-colored tights to accent your coord.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:43.860
It's lovely!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.360
Hold it!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:53.200
Throw out your hand like you mean it!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.700
Like this?

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:57.910
Yes, that will make your dance appear more dynamic.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:58.580
Okay!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.830
Your face looks completely different now.{You have a whole new look on your face.}

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.590
Wait, please don't tell me I gained weight!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:11.550
I asked Rola to help me out with my jogging, but that just makes me hungry...

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:16.970
Also, I keep treating Ako-chan to cake in exchange for teaching me her MC tricks,

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.430
but I end up eating it with her...

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:25.650
And Mahiru-chan keeps telling me I need to maintain my figure...

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.610
Hime-senpai, did my face get round?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.910
That's not what I meant.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.370
I just noticed that your face seemed to be shining.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:43.210
Everyone is lending you their time and effort because they believe you can do it.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.840
And that includes me as well.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:49.130
So, you see? Be confident.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.130
I will.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.010
Here.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.720
Thank you for before.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:16:00.180
I don't plan on crying anymore!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.900
<i>Lions drop their young from cliffs. {our original tl is lost to the ages}{wait, what}{there was an episode where orihime did this}</i>

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:13.740
<i>Nijino Yume, I'm certain you can climb your way back up.</i>

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.040
<i>Isn't that right, Nee-san?</i>

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.550
Nijino Yume, ready for my solo live!

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.880
Yay!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.550
Come in.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.220
Yo, pickled octopus.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:35.550
What are you calling me?{specifically the name about}

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.890
You'd been looking so sour lately.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.560
So why are you here?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:45.230
We're doing a concert next door in the Horizon Hall.

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.940
And, you know...

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:52.690
We'll put on our best show, so you'd better do it too.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:57.700
I will! I'm going to be confident and sing the best I can!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.950
R-Right.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.910
Subaru-kun's so cute. {ahh, it's a kasumi habit}

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.540
Just look at him blush.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.870
Guys, this isn't cool.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.010
We'll put on our best show, so you'd better do it too.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.300
Pretty smooth.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.970
Knock it off, you two.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.720
I didn't mean it like that.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:21.600
Come on, it's time to focus.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.560
I have friends who support me,

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:32.320
a rival to fight alongside me,

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.490
and a senpai who always lights my path.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.950
Everyone believes in me.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.160
I'll believe in myself too!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.750
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:50.680
Yume! {can they do this?}{as far as I'm concerned, anything can happen during the concert sections since I don't watch them}

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.190
That was amazing!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.560
Yeah, you gave me goosebumps!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:56.770
Thanks!

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.400
You did it!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:03.150
You made it over ninety percent!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.740
That's great, Yume!

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:12.660
Well, you can attribute at least half of that to the MC secrets I shared with you.

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:15.120
Everyone, thank you!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.710
Yume-chan overcame it.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:21.170
Yes, she'll be fine now.

00:21:21.170 --> 00:21:25.300
Nijino will grow stronger upon the foundation she laid today.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:34.980
Rola, did you see? I finished my concert without relying on that mysterious power.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.020
Yeah.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:39.400
That was the best performance you've ever had.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:40.400
Really?

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:41.480
Really!

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.030
All right, that means it's time for me to step it up!

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:47.780
Our real battle starts now!

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:52.080
Nice Aikatsu!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:59.790
<i>Hotaru-san, thank you for everything.</i>

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.420
<i>You helped me put on a fantastic show.</i>

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.390
<i>After my concert ended, I suddenly got really hungry.</i>

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:11.970
<i>I got the urge to have your rose tea and rose chiffon cake again.</i>

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:15.980
<i>Do you mind if I come see you again someday?</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:18.560
<i>I'll bring Hime-senpai with me next time.</i>

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:14.640
